# sundev.pl

Personal-professional micro blog. Markdown content → Astro static build → Apache on Kylos Silver.

## Stack
- **Astro 4.x**, `output: 'static'`, TypeScript strict, **Node 20**
- **Plain CSS** — CSS custom properties only, no framework
- `@astrojs/sitemap` + `@astrojs/rss` installed
- **GitHub Actions** CI/CD: push `main` → `npm run build` → FTPS upload via `lftp` to Kylos

## How Hosting Works
Kylos Silver = Apache serving static files. **No Node.js on the server.** Astro only runs on GitHub Actions at build time. The output is pure HTML/CSS/JS. Never suggest server-side Astro features (`output: 'server'`, API routes, SSR adapters).

## Publishing Workflow
```
write .md → git push main → GitHub Actions → Kylos
```
- `main` branch = production; every push auto-deploys
- `draft/post-name` branches = work in progress
- `draft: true` in frontmatter = excluded from build

## Key Files
| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `src/content/config.ts` | Zod schemas for `blog` + `articles` collections |
| `src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro` | Single layout — props: `title`, `description`, optional `canonicalURL` |
| `src/styles/global.css` | All global styles + CSS custom properties |
| `public/.htaccess` | HTTPS redirect, pretty URLs, asset cache headers |
| `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` | CI/CD pipeline — FTPS deploy via `lftp` |

## CSS Custom Properties (defined in `global.css`)
```css
--color-bg, --color-surface, --color-text, --color-muted, --color-accent, --color-border
--font-sans, --font-mono
--text-sm, --text-base, --text-lg, --text-xl, --text-2xl, --text-3xl
--space-1 through --space-16
--radius
--max-prose  (68ch)
```
Dark mode via `@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)` — the tokens switch automatically.

## CSS Classes (defined in `global.css`)
`.container`, `.prose`, `.post-list`, `.post-item`, `.post-header`, `.post-meta`, `.tags`, `.tag`, `.section-heading`

## Constraints
- No `any` TypeScript
- No `client:` directives unless essential
- No inline styles — use CSS custom properties
- Images: `<Image>` from `astro:assets`, never bare `<img>`
- Never commit `dist/`
